<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Hutchinson up on EPS news.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Hutchinson up on EPS news.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>News of expected quarterly earnings far beyond analyst expectations sent Hutchinson Technology Inc shares to 60 from 52-3/4 preceding Tuesday's market open, traders said.</p>
<p>Earlier today, the maker of disk drive suspension assemblies said it expects fiscal 1997 first quarter net sales of $104 to $109 million and earnings of $1.50 to $1.90 per share.</p>
<p>The First Call consensus earnings estimate is $0.71 per share.</p>
</text>
